WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.085
Roxy was buried under a huge pile of rocks.

2
00:00:16.085 --> 00:00:19.927
"It's a good thing I'm Rocket Girl," thought Roxy.

3
00:00:19.927 --> 00:00:22.156
"I didn't get hurt at all.

4
00:00:22.157 --> 00:00:26.630
But how will I stop the mole men from destroying Metro City?"

5
00:00:26.631 --> 00:00:28.588
She thought for a moment.

6
00:00:28.588 --> 00:00:31.302
"I have an idea!"

7
00:00:31.302 --> 00:00:34.530
Again Roxy spun fast.

8
00:00:34.531 --> 00:00:38.792
She drilled into the ground below the cave.

9
00:00:38.792 --> 00:00:41.668
Roxy listened carefully.

10
00:00:41.668 --> 00:00:45.140
She heard the mole men above her.

11
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.318
"Where did the human go?" one asked.

12
00:00:49.319 --> 00:00:54.720
"I trapped her under that pile of rocks!" said the mole man near the machine.

13
00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:59.081
Roxy looked up, using her x-ray vision.

14
00:00:59.081 --> 00:01:04.540
The mole men started searching through the pile of rocks.

15
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.043
She could also see the bottom of the earthquake machine.

16
00:01:09.044 --> 00:01:12.886
"I need to destroy that machine," thought Roxy.

17
00:01:12.886 --> 00:01:16.929
She blasted up toward the machine.

18
00:01:16.929 --> 00:01:18.654
Boom!

19
00:01:18.655 --> 00:01:24.390
Roxy burst through the cave's floor and smashed the machine to pieces.

20
00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:29.184
"She destroyed our earthquake machine!" cried a mole man.

21
00:01:29.184 --> 00:01:32.227
"Get her!" shouted another one.

22
00:01:32.227 --> 00:01:35.363
The mole men rushed toward Roxy.

23
00:01:35.363 --> 00:01:37.623
Roxy flew up into the air.

24
00:01:37.623 --> 00:01:43.645
The mole men ran straight into one another, swinging their pipes. Crash!

25
00:01:43.646 --> 00:01:47.067
"Ouch! You hit me!" cried one.

26
00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:52.133
"Sorry! I didn't—oof! Who hit my head?" said another.

27
00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:57.447
"Oops!" said a third. "I thought you were—ouch!"

28
00:01:57.447 --> 00:02:01.711
As the mole men fought, Roxy glanced around the cave.

29
00:02:01.711 --> 00:02:04.759
She saw tires, pipes, and other items.

30
00:02:04.759 --> 00:02:07.891
She then saw some electrical wire.

31
00:02:07.891 --> 00:02:16.157
She grabbed the wire and quickly tied up the mole men.

32
00:02:16.157 --> 00:02:19.250
"Let us go!" shouted one mole man.

33
00:02:19.251 --> 00:02:22.283
"You can't do this to us," cried another.

34
00:02:22.283 --> 00:02:25.552
"The underground belongs to the mole men!"

35
00:02:25.552 --> 00:02:29.860
"You'd better get used to living above ground," said Roxy.

36
00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:35.244
"Because I'm taking you to jail!"

37
00:02:35.245 --> 00:02:39.292
Terrell, Jack, and Mara were walking away from the soccer field.

38
00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.989
They heard a rumble and looked back.

39
00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:45.664
The equipment shed popped out of the ground, followed by . . .

40
00:02:45.664 --> 00:02:49.544
"Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

41
00:02:49.545 --> 00:02:52.429
Later Roxy returned to the soccer field.

42
00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:55.618
Mara, Terrell, and Jack were practicing soccer.

43
00:02:55.618 --> 00:02:58.900
Coach Nicole spotted Roxy and waved.

44
00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:04.106
"Wow!" said Roxy. "The equipment shed is back!"

45
00:03:04.106 --> 00:03:09.062
"Guess who found it!" said Terrell. "Rocket Girl!"

46
00:03:09.062 --> 00:03:12.380
"Really?" Roxy pretended she didn't know.

47
00:03:12.381 --> 00:03:14.445
"I guess I was wrong, Terrell.

48
00:03:14.445 --> 00:03:18.830
Rocket Girl was able to get the shed out of the ground!"

49
00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.543
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

50
00:03:21.543 --> 00:03:23.800
Roxy smiled.

51
00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:30.204
She grabbed a soccer ball and started to dribble it down the field.
